{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-tourn-110"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816260-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 타임 에이전시 은행의 직원 창구 앞에 앉아 있다. 수조를 통해 아담한 직원이 프로세서 앞에서 피부색을 바꾸며 대략적인 개설 절차를 설명한다","talkId":403816260,"textHash":"346085043575981987","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/talk-403816260","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1309356d68575b5f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816261-line"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816261-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「다시 확인해 드리겠습니다. 100 표준 시간의 정기 예금에 가입하게 되시며, 2% 이율에 따라 타임 에이전시 은행은 5 공전주기 후 이자를 지급해 드립니다. 확인 후 문제가 없다면 개설 절차에 따라 인증을 진행해주세요」","talkId":403816261,"textHash":"3566119699397758796","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/talk-403816261","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1309356d68575b5f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816262-line"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816262-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 고개를 끄덕이고 양손을 뻗었다. 스크린을 사이에 두고 손가락과 직원 촉수가 맞닿아 1 대 1 신분 인증을 완료했다","talkId":403816262,"textHash":"1444353041104140105","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/talk-403816262","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1309356d68575b5f","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816263-line"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816263-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「계정 보안을 위해, 개설 전 2차 보안 질문을 설정해주세요. 스크린에서 후속 작업을 완료하시면 됩니다」","talkId":403816263,"textHash":"4007761176717271520","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/talk-403816263","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1309356d68575b5f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18016369363893169877-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"토마토의 끝부분","talkId":null,"textHash":"18016369363893169877","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/text-18016369363893169877","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"125776322e952e77","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-1475814299079052968-effect"],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-1475814299079052968-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"나의 출생지는 토마토의 끝부분이다","talkId":null,"textHash":"1475814299079052968","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/text-1475814299079052968","flowStatus":"review","bwik