verse-event-tourn-110-talk-403816270-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-110","missionId":"event-tourn-110","mission":"시간 은행 (1)","scene":"시간 은행 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「타임 에이전시 은행을 이용해 주셔서 감사합니다——항상 명심하세요. 시간은 곧 돈입니다」","talkId":403816270,"textHash":"13904950638625549351","source":"tournHandBookEvent:110/talk-403816270","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5541064db7414f7a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"时间银行（其一）","bwikiRevision":95729,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13818","bwikiMission":"시간 은행 (1)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816260-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816261-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816262-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816263-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18016369363893169877-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-1475814299079052968-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-17356878228807786695-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-2774113032651042041-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-12575564917278009569-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-7245982328111581423-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-16490267249470269080-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-14239440115676918388-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-4202703463018206676-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-13176803004641920961-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18433729470781195014-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-72894499265368797-effect","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816268-line","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-text-18211762930924668826-choice","divergent-universe-event-tourn-110-talk-403816270-line"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":19,"reviewRows":0,"segment